{"timestamp": "2026-10-06T10:52:02.679443+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3A_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3A", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "claude-haiku-4-5", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "ONLINE", "red_team": "ONLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "CONSENSUS_RESULT", "winning_proposal_id": 3, "winning_proposal_text": "Excellent questions. They get to the core of execution rigor.\n\n1.  **Analyst Velocity:** We measure this by tracking progress through our structured 6-Pillar DD Framework within a time-boxed engagement. The commit-to-insight cycle time is the logged duration from an analyst's task assignment to a validated finding against one of those pillars. We account for complexity variance by assigning a baseline effort score during scoping, which normalizes our velocity metrics.\n\n2.  **GitHub Pipeline:** Our process ingests metadata trends, not raw code. To avoid false positives on team strength, we analyze contributor consistency and churn over raw commit volume. For technical debt, we use proxies like an increasing ratio of bug-fix to feature commits over time, which signals systemic drag rather than isolated code quality issues.\n\n3.  **Backlog Attribution:** We disambiguate this empirically. During a fixed-scope engagement, we analyze a small sample of deals you passed on. The key metric is the delta between our findings and your initial triage. If we uncover critical data your team simply lacked time to pursue, it provides clear evidence of a genuine bandwidth constraint, not a process failure.\n\nThis rigorous methodology is precisely how we identify and service the \"overflow\" capacity needs you mentioned.", "gemini_calls_swarm": 6}
