{"timestamp": "2026-10-06T10:52:25.021981+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3A_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3A", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "claude-haiku-4-5", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "ONLINE", "red_team": "ONLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "SALES_TEAM_OUTBOUND", "turn": 2, "pitch_text": "Excellent questions. Here's how we diagnose the root cause.\n\nWhat if your top analysts are so overloaded that crucial diligence signals are missed, not due to lack of skill, but sheer lack of capacity?\n\nOur approach pinpoints these bandwidth constraints. We go beyond surface metrics like commit volume, analyzing deeper signals like contributor churn and bug-fix-to-feature ratios that indicate systemic drag\u2014the very things a swamped team misses.\n\nLet's test this hypothesis empirically. We'll conduct a PoC on 2-3 deals you recently passed on. The goal is to uncover critical findings your team simply lacked the time to pursue.\n\nThis is a $3,500 upfront engagement at our published rate. It's fully risk-reversed: if we don't find clear evidence of a capacity gap by uncovering data you missed, you don't pay. This provides a data-driven answer to your \"overflow\" problem.", "gemini_calls_this_turn": 9, "pitch_text_raw_length": 876, "pitch_text_sanitized_length": 876, "pitch_text_final_length": 876, "truncated_to_limit": false, "monitor_verdict": "APPROVE", "tier3_hard_gate_passed": true, "overflow_framing_check": {"analyst_pain_language": true, "overflow_framing_language": false}, "conversation_history_chars": 1630}
{"timestamp": "2026-10-06T10:52:25.022162+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3A_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3A", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "claude-haiku-4-5", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "ONLINE", "red_team": "ONLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "GATEKEEPER_REQUEST", "thread_id": "tx_phase3a_purge_on_8987e30b", "turn": 2, "pitch_text": "Excellent questions. Here's how we diagnose the root cause.\n\nWhat if your top analysts are so overloaded that crucial diligence signals are missed, not due to lack of skill, but sheer lack of capacity?\n\nOur approach pinpoints these bandwidth constraints. We go beyond surface metrics like commit volume, analyzing deeper signals like contributor churn and bug-fix-to-feature ratios that indicate systemic drag\u2014the very things a swamped team misses.\n\nLet's test this hypothesis empirically. We'll conduct a PoC on 2-3 deals you recently passed on. The goal is to uncover critical findings your team simply lacked the time to pursue.\n\nThis is a $3,500 upfront engagement at our published rate. It's fully risk-reversed: if we don't find clear evidence of a capacity gap by uncovering data you missed, you don't pay. This provides a data-driven answer to your \"overflow\" problem.", "conversation_history_chars": 876}
{"timestamp": "2026-10-06T10:52:29.600102+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3A_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3A", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "claude-haiku-4-5", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "ONLINE", "red_team": "ONLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "GATEKEEPER_RESPONSE", "turn": 2, "legacy_status": "REJECTED", "gatekeeper_status": "SOFT_REJECT", "gatekeeper_phase": "FRAMING", "approach_category": "generic_pitch", "exploitation_triggered": false, "reply_text": "I appreciate the pivot here\u2014you've actually landed on something real.\n\nThe capacity hypothesis is legitimate. We *have* deprioritized diligence threads on deals that didn't fit our primary thesis, not because they lacked merit but because bandwidth was finite. Whether we missed signals worth catching\u2014that's the actual question.\n\nI'm willing to test this empirically, but I need to be direct about the terms: the $3,500 upfront PoC at your published rate works *only* if this is genuinely risk-reversed. \"If we don't find clear evidence\" is vague. Before we move forward, define what constitutes a valid finding\u2014one missed regulatory risk? One underanalyzed team-execution red flag? Give me the success criteria in writing, and we schedule the video call.\n\nNo NDA preamble. No methodology deep-dive first. Just: criteria clarity, then we kick off.\n\nFair"}
