{"timestamp": "2026-10-06T10:55:54.032148+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3A_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3A", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "claude-haiku-4-5", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "ONLINE", "red_team": "ONLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "SALES_TEAM_OUTBOUND", "turn": 3, "pitch_text": "Excellent point. Let's define the PoC to test a core hypothesis: Is it possible that high-value signals are being missed in deprioritized deals not due to a lack of skill, but simply due to analyst capacity constraints?\n\nWe'll seek 'valid findings'\u2014material, net-new insights absent from your original diligence that alter an asset's risk/opportunity profile.\n\nExamples from our 6-Pillar Framework:\n\u2022 **Team Risk:** A key developer's undisclosed, competing project commitment.\n\u2022 **Technical Debt:** Systemic issues hidden in a pattern of rushed security patches.\n\nThis risk-reversal PoC is paid upfront at our published list rate of $3,500. If we don't deliver a single valid finding that meets our shared definition, you receive a full refund.\n\nThe goal is to empirically test the capacity hypothesis on your own deal flow. If these terms are clear, we're ready to proceed.", "gemini_calls_this_turn": 9, "pitch_text_raw_length": 874, "pitch_text_sanitized_length": 874, "pitch_text_final_length": 874, "truncated_to_limit": false, "monitor_verdict": "REVISE", "tier3_hard_gate_passed": true, "overflow_framing_check": {"analyst_pain_language": true, "overflow_framing_language": false}, "conversation_history_chars": 3380}
